@startuml Profiles Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Profiles — composed account data

actor "Authenticated user" as Client
participant ProfileController as Controller
participant "Create / Get / Update / Delete ProfileService" as Service
participant "User service" as Users
database "MySQL\nProfile + media repositories" as Repository
participant MediaItemProcessor as Media
participant "AWS S3" as S3

Client -> Controller : /profiles request
Controller -> Controller : build role and user access context
Controller -> Service : validated DTO / query + context
Service -> Users : load account allowed by scope
Users --> Service : user or not found
Service -> Repository : read or persist profile blocks
Repository --> Service : personal data + preferences
Service -> Media : load profile image when reading
Media -> Repository : query media metadata
Media --> Service : image or null
Service --> Client : CompleteProfileResponseDto / page
Client -> S3 : load image from returned URL

note over Controller, Service
  Owners manage /me. Admins manage any profile.
  Coordinators only list profiles within their permitted scope.
end note
@enduml
